No, you *will* need to alter the spelling.  Fairly substantially, in
some cases.

But there is software to do the alteration for us; just need to get
ahold of it.  I'll post a text file with the altered versions then.

And hopefully smart.fm will have mass upload soon.

The idea is to put the Polish spelling of the Lojban sounds in the
word area, and the actual Lojban spelling in the transliteration
area.

-Robin

